      "content": "it's just... talking to people feels like more work. it's just more noise. i don't want \"help\" or \"solutions\" or someone telling me how to fix it. i just feel like i've reached the end of my rope and there's nothing left in the tank. does that even make sense? i'm just so done with everything.",
