    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest... yeah. but rest doesn't work for this kind of thing. i sleep and i still feel just as heavy when i wake up. it feels like no matter what i do, i'm just dragging this weight around forever. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i could just... stop. not just sleep, but like, actually stop the struggle entirely. it feels like the only way to finally be at peace.",
